  "description": "Task 9 (2026-07-12): the old issueLifecycle FSM (tatara_lifecycle_state/tatara_lifecycle_transition_total/tatara_lifecycle_seconds/tatara_mrci_wait_seconds/tatara_lifecycle_giveup_total/tatara_lifecycle_handover_total/tatara_lifecycle_idle_stop_total/tatara_lifecycle_implement_empty_retry_total) dies WITH the task-centric redesign (contract L.1) and none of it is on scripts/metrics_allowlist.txt. Every panel below is repointed onto the Task lifecycle metrics (operator_task_state, operator_task_parked_total, operator_task_terminal_total, operator_agent_pod_ttl_expired_total) where a successor metric exists; three panels with no successor (transition rate, full-lifecycle latency, MRCI wait) were deleted outright rather than left querying a dead metric. Repointed again 2026-08-08 (#97) onto tatara-operator v2.0.0: operator_task_stage -> operator_task_state, and the stage/stageReason labels -> state / stateReason (terminal) / parkReason (park). Verified against the operator internal/obs at origin/main and against live Prometheus, not assumed.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "description": "Current Task count in each state (operator_task_state). Repointed onto the tatara-operator v2.0.0 8-state lifecycle (#97, 2026-08-08): the enum is exactly new, refined, under-implementation, awaiting-review, merged, deployed, done, rejected. `parked` and `failed` are NOT states any more - park is an orthogonal flag (see the parks panel below) and the terminal set is exactly done|rejected. Terminal states normally dominate by orders of magnitude, so each state is shown as its own stat tile rather than a shared axis.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {"mode": "palette-classic"},
          "mappings": [],
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{"color": "green", "value": null}]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {"h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0},
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
